QuestGuidance.Register("en",216,{
[6881]="70027B2C\n1\tTalk to Baldgar\tBaldgar is in his cell. He wants to speak with you one last time before you begin.\n2\tFind the Uruk-hai key-master\tThe key-master is somewhere in the dungeons. Baldgar wants you to take him by surprise, and told you to climb the slope, turning right into the other wing of the dungeons when you have the opportunity.\n3\tTalk to the Dunlending prisoner\tOne of the Dunlending prisoners has tried to attract your attention.\n4\tReturn to Baldgar\tYou have recovered the keys from the Uruk-hai key-master.\n5\tTalk to Baldgar\tYou have freed Baldgar and Acca from their cells, and now Baldgar wants to speak with you.\n6\tTalk to Acca\tAcca is ready to speak with you.\n7\tRun up the slope to the entrance to the dungeons with Acca and Baldgar\tYou, Baldgar, and Acca will go before the rest of the prisoners, running up the slope to the entrance to the dungeons.\n8\tTalk to Baldgar just inside the entrance to the dungeons\tBaldgar wants to speak with you before you leave the dungeons.\n9\tWalk slowly through the large room with Baldgar and Acca so as not to attract attention\tYou need to walk slowly through the large, open room with Baldgar and Acca so as not to attract undue attention. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n10\tTalk to Baldgar\tYou have made it to the surface of Isengard. You are almost there!\n11\tTalk to Acca\tAcca has volunteered to light the black powder to provide you with the distraction which you need to escape.\n12\tWait with Baldgar for Acca's signal: an enormous blast of flame and smoke\tAcca has gone to light the black powder, and you should hide with Baldgar until you see the signal: a giant plume of smoke and flame!\n13\tTalk to Baldgar\tYou are hiding with Baldgar, still awaiting Acca's signal.\n14\tTalk to Morflak and keep him busy\tMorflak has killed Acca, and now Baldgar wants you to keep Morflak busy so that he can light the black powder.\n",
[6882]="7001AC1A\n1\tTalk to Bróin\tBróin is waiting to speak with you in the depths of Rushdurinul.\n2\tListen to the discussion of Mazog's fate\tThe Elves and dwarves are discussing the fate of Mazog.\n3\tGive Bróin your opinion of his decision concerning Mazog's fate\tBróin is in the depths of Rushdurinul, waiting to hear what you have to say concerning the fate of Mazog.\n4\tListen to the discussion concerning Mazog's fate\tThe Elves and dwarves within Rushdurinul are considering the various implications of what must be done with Mazog.\n5\tTalk to Bróin\tBróin is waiting to speak with you in Rushdurinul.\n6\tShackle Mazog\tMazog is in Rushdurinul. You must bind him with the shackles Bróin has given you.\n7\tTalk to Bróin\tBróin is in Rushdurinul, waiting to speak with you now that Mazog is shackled.\n8\tUse the banner to change your allies' support role\tBróin has told you how to modify the support role of your allies, by using the banner he has set up, and is waiting for you to do so.\n9\tProtect Bróin from the attacking Orcs\tThe escape from Rushdurinul has begun -- you must defend Bróin from the attack of the Orcs!\n10\tTalk to Mazog\tYou have come to the entrance to Zurr-thurkh and should now ensure that Mazog's words are merely empty bluster before leaving. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n11\tTalk to Bróin\tDespite his attempt to escape, you have forced Mazog to submit. You should speak now with Bróin.\n",
[6883]="70059A01\n1\tTalk to Trausti outside Vatug-ronk\tTrausti has come with you to search Vatug-ronk for Eskil Bloodthumb and his stolen axe.\n2\tTalk to the weary Orc by the camp-fire and learn what befell the camp\tSomething passed through the encampment of Vatug-ronk and slew the Orcs within. Those who remain are too weary or injured to offer much resistance.\n3\tTalk to Trausti by the camp-fire\tTrausti wants to search Vatug-ronk for Eskil Bloodthumb.\n4\tTalk to Trausti in Vatug-ronk\tYou and Trausti have discovered where Eskil Bloodthumb is held captive within Vatug-ronk.\n5\tTalk to Eskil beside the cage\tYou have defeated the reinforcements Gorgar sent to Vatug-ronk to deal with the hobgoblins. You should speak with Eskil to ensure he is safe and will recover from his ordeal.\n",
[6884]="70041352\n1\tTalk to Legolas on the docks\tLegolas, Aragorn, and Gimli have fought through the city to the docks. Legolas is waiting to speak with you concerning the number of allies you might have ready at hand.\n2\tTalk to Legolas and declare your intentions\tLegolas has asked if you plan to take on Balakhôr by yourself or if you have a Fellowship near at hand.\n3\tTalk to Aragorn on the docks of Pelargir\tAragorn is on the docks of Pelargir, waiting to storm the Night-jewel in search of Balakhôr.\n4\tThe Corsairs have enslaved the people of Gondor as they moved up the coast toward Pelargir. Now it is time to free these slaves from the benches to which they are chained.\t\n5\tTalk to Umer on the deck of the Night-jewel\tUmer has come out onto the deck of the Night-jewel, ready to face you at last.\n6\tTalk to Aragorn on the deck of the Night-jewel\tAragorn has returned to the deck of the Night-jewel, unable to find Balakhôr below-decks.\n7\tTalk to Aragorn on the Night-jewel\tBalakhôr has been defeated, and now Aragorn wishes to speak with you on the deck of the Night-jewel.\n8\tTalk to Gimli at Aragorn's camp\tThe Corsairs have been defeated and Pelargir retaken. One task remains. Gimli wishes to speak with you about the next step Aragorn plans to take.\n9\tStay on guard while Aragorn speaks to the King of the Dead\tAragorn speaks now to the Dead Men of Dunharrow, who have fulfilled their oath to fight against Sauron's forces.\n10\tTalk to Aragorn at his camp\tThe Dead Men have departed, and now Aragorn wishes to speak with you.\n",
[6885]="70037DB7\n1\tTalk to Horn in Edoras\tHorn is waiting to speak with you on the road through the market, in Edoras.\n2\tTalk to Nona in Edoras\tNona has been confronted by a number of children in Edoras, and she does not seem happy about it.\n3\tTalk to Corudan in Edoras\tCorudan is in the market in Edoras, amused by the recent turn of events concerning Nona and the Rohirrim children.\n4\tTalk to Éowyn on the steps outside Meduseld\tÉowyn is on the steps outside Meduseld.\n5\tTalk to Céolflad in Edoras, north-east of the Meduseld steps\tCéolflad is north-east of the Meduseld steps, outside her home. Éowyn has asked you to speak to Céolflad and obtain a description of the suspicious figure that interfered with her duty to empty the city.\n6\tAsk Céolflad questions about the suspicious man she saw in Edoras\tCéolflad saw a suspicious figure in Edoras, and now you should ask her questions to learn what you can of his appearance.\n7\tTalk to Éowyn outside Céolflad's house\tÉowyn has hurried up to you near Céolflad with news.\n8\tFind Elfburg and question her about the suspicious man she saw in Edoras\tElfburg is in Edoras, north of Céolflad's home. She too has seen a suspicious figure in Edoras, and Éowyn would like you to ask her questions as well.\n9\tTalk to Horn in Edoras\tHorn has come to your position near Elfburg, and you should tell him what you have learned.\n",
[6886]="7002EE1F\n1\tWatch the discourse between Reeve Ingbert, Lady Góda, and Lord Ingmar.\t\n2\tTalk to Lord Ingmar\tSpeak with Lord Ingmar.\n3\tWatch the discourse between Reeve Ingbert, Lady Góda, and Lord Ingmar.\t\n4\tTalk to Lady Góda\tSpeak with Lady Góda.\n5\tWatch the discourse between Reeve Ingbert, Lady Góda, and Lord Ingmar.\t\n6\tYou tell the Reeve that you must know more of the situation before you can provide him with adequate advice\tSpeak with Reeve Ingbert.\n",
[6887]="7006D136\n1\tCalm Raphûz's nerves and begin the hunt\tRaphûz appears nervous. Speak with his to calm his nerves and begin your search for Urushagân.\n2\tSpeak with Raphûz and continue the hunt\tYou fought alongside Raphûz to the centre of the boar den. He looks as though he could use some reassurance. Speak with him.\n3\tSpeak with Raphûz to continue the hunt\tRaphûz's confidence is building. He believes Urushagân must be further in the boar den.\n4\tSpeak with Raphûz to continue the hunt\tRaphûz is undeterred by not yet finding Urushagân. He urges you to help him press onward.\n5\tSpeak to Raphûz\tAfter defeating the beast Raphûz wants to speak to you in a safer part of the area.\n",
[6888]="70041793\n1\tTalk to Faltharan\tFaltharan can be located at the stairs near the east gate. You should speak with Faltharan.\n2\tAid Faltharan as he confronts Lorvegil\tFaltharan can be located at the stairs near the east gate. You should aid Faltharan as he attempts to confront Lorvegil.\n3\tConfront Lorvegil\tLorvegil can be found to the west of the eastern gate. Speak with Lorvegil in order to confront him about his crimes.\n4\tTalk to Faltharan\tFaltharan can be found to the west of the eastern gate. You should speak with Faltharan.\n",
[6889]="7002825C\n1\tDefeat Dunlendings at Wulf's Cleft\tBedwur instructed you to inflict as much damage as possible upon the army at Wulf's Cleft.\n",
[6890]="700208AF\n1\tTalk to Calenglad\tCalenglad is in the Flooded Ward of Annúminas.\n2\tTalk to Calenglad\tCalenglad is standing in front of a tomb-entrance in the Flooded Ward.\n3\tInvestigate the tomb-robbers' plunder\tThe robbers have put their gathered plunder into a strongbox located within the crypt.\n4\tWait until Calenglad is satisfied that he can join the Grey Company\tCalenglad is speaking with Gwindeth, the Blue Lady of Nenuial.\n5\tTalk to Calenglad at Tinnudir\tCalenglad is inside the crypt in the Flooded Ward, waiting to speak with you.\n",
[6891]="70041790\n1\tTalk to Faltharan\tFaltharan is located at the shipyard. You should speak with Faltharan.\n2\tObserve the farewell\tFaltharan is located at the shipyard. You should accompany Faltharan as he says his good-byes.\n3\tTalk to Faltharan\tFaltharan is located at the shipyard. You should speak with Faltharan.\n",
[6892]="70072FAE\n1\tListen to Irsinith\tIrsinith wishes to tell you more about Amûma and her duty as her warden.\n2\tSpeak with Irsinith\tIrsinith wishes to tell you more about Amûma and her duty as her warden.\n3\tListen to Irsinith\tIrsinith wishes to tell you more about Amûma and her duty as her warden.\n4\tSpeak with Irsinith\tIrsinith wishes to tell you more about Amûma and her duty as her warden.\n5\tListen to Irsinith\tIrsinith wishes to tell you more about Amûma and her duty as her warden.\n6\tSpeak with Irsinith\tIrsinith wishes to tell you more about Amûma and her duty as her warden.\n",
[6893]="70072FAB\n1\tFollow the tracks to the source of the Pale Blight\tScouts in Sul Madásh believe they have discovered the source of the Pale Blight with an unknown enemy being spotted near the ruins of Nagakhêdi to the south. Follow the tracks the scouts discovered to the east of the camp.\n2\tFollow the tracks to the source of the Pale Blight\tScouts in Sul Madásh believe they have discovered the source of the Pale Blight with an unknown enemy being spotted near the ruins of Nagakhêdi to the south. Follow the tracks the scouts discovered to the east of the camp.\n3\tFollow the tracks to the source of the Pale Blight\tScouts in Sul Madásh believe they have discovered the source of the Pale Blight with an unknown enemy being spotted near the ruins of Nagakhêdi to the south. Follow the tracks the scouts discovered to the east of the camp.\n4\tFollow the tracks to the source of the Pale Blight\tScouts in Sul Madásh believe they have discovered the source of the Pale Blight with an unknown enemy being spotted near the ruins of Nagakhêdi to the south. Follow the tracks the scouts discovered to the east of the camp.\n5\tFollow the tracks to the source of the Pale Blight\tScouts in Sul Madásh believe they have discovered the source of the Pale Blight with an unknown enemy being spotted near the ruins of Nagakhêdi to the south. Follow the tracks the scouts discovered to the east of the camp.\n6\tKill the morroval\tThe tracks led you to the ruins of Nagakhêdi and a morroval has appeared to stop you. Defeat her!\n7\tSpeak with the scout and return to Sul Madásh\tYou have defeated the morroval that you encountered at the ruins of Nagakhêdi. Return to Sul Madásh with the scout to report to Dáthlil.\n",
[6894]="70072FA9\n1\tDrink the Pale Blight serum\tTest the Pale Blight serum that the Viznak and the Rangers made to ensure it protects the imbiber from the rot.\n2\tEat the blue mushroom\030Eat the green mushroom\030Eat the red mushroom\030Eat the yellow mushroom\tYou drank the serum, now it is time to eat the blighted mushrooms and see what happens!\n3\tSpeak with Viznak\tYou drank the serum and ate the mushrooms. Speak with Viznak again to see what is next.\n",
[6895]="7005739C\n1\tTalk to Rúzat\tTalk to Rúzat.\n2\tJourney to Ered Mithrin with the dwarves\tJourney to Ered Mithrin with the dwarves.\n3\tDefeat the ambushers\tDefeat the ambushers. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[6896]="70048BFE\n1\tExamine the Black Númenórean shown to you by Zaghárog\tHazy images swirl before your eyes of the delving of the Caverns of Fire, long ago.\n2\tWitness the images shown to you by Zaghárog\tZaghárog presents you with images from the delving of a fortress in the depths of the Caverns of Fire, long ago.\n3\tExamine the creature shown to you by Zaghárog\tHazy images swirl before your eyes of the delving of the Caverns of Fire, long ago.\n4\tWitness the images shown to you by Zaghárog\tZaghárog presents you with images from the delving of a fortress in the depths of the Caverns of Fire, long ago.\n5\tWitness the images shown to you by Zaghárog\tHazy images swirl before your eyes of the delving of the Caverns of Fire, long ago.\n6\tExamine the Ghâsh-hai shown to you by Zaghárog\tThe Orc you see now is different than those that served Urudanî, but you have seen his kind before: he is one of the Ghâsh-hai.\n7\tWitness the images shown to you by Zaghárog\tZaghárog presents you with images from the delving of a fortress in the depths of the Caverns of Fire, long ago.\n8\tWitness the images shown to you by Zaghárog\tZaghárog presents you with images from the delving of a fortress in the depths of the Caverns of Fire, long ago.\n9\tExamine the image shown to you by Zaghárog\tZaghárog persists in showing you images of the past.\n",
[6897]="70021D90\n1\tFind and confront Fernvael\tFind Fernvael's resting place and present the shade with the amulet you remade.\n",
