[6904]="70035F42\n1\tSpeak with Thrymm\tThrymm, Cyneberg, and Gárwig are prepared to defeat Núrzum. Speak with Thrymm along the ice bridge.\n2\tGet close enough for Núrzum to hear the Winter's Horn\tThe giant Núrzum is heading to Forlaw in an attempt to extinguish the last bastion of hope for the people of Wildermore. Run towards Núrzum until you're close enough for him to hear the sound of the Winter's Horn.\n3\tBlow the Winter's Horn to get Núrzum's attention\tYou are close enough to Núrzum for him to hear the sound of the Winter's Horn. Blow the horn to get the giant's attention.\n4\tDefeat frost grims\tClear the area of all threats before using the Winter's Horn again.\n5\tSound the Winter's Horn\tSound the Winter's Horn to damage Núrzum.\n6\tDefeat frost grims\tClear the area of all threats before using the Winter's Horn again.\n7\tSound the Winter's Horn\tSound the Winter's Horn to further damage Núrzum.\n8\tDefeat frost grims\tClear the area of all threats before using the Winter's Horn again.\n9\tSound the Winter's Horn to defeat Núrzum\tNúrzum has been weakened. It should take one more sounding of the horn to finish him off.\n10\tProtect Gárwig\tThe Winter's Horn caused massive damage to Núrzum, but he struggles through the pain. Make sure that Gárwig remains protected.\n11\tSpeak with Thrymm\tNúrzum has been defeated. The people of Wildermore will be terrorized no longer. Speak with Thrymm.\n",
[6905]="7002CB29\n1\tTalk to the Great Eagle, Meneldor\tLandroval has asked you to search for signs of Meneldor in the cave and to lend him aid if you happen upon him.\n2\tDefeat the spider, Meneghen\tMeneldor has warned you of the presence of a dangerous creature in the cave. This threat must be dealt with quickly before attempting to free the Great Eagle.\n3\tTalk to Meneldor and release him from the webbing\tMeneldor remains entagled in the spider's webbing. He may safely break free now that the spider-queen has been defeated\n4\tTalk to Meneldor to leave the spider-cave\tMeneldor has escaped the webbing and wishes to depart from the cave at once.\n",
[6906]="70046CCC\n1\tTalk to Mithrandir\tTalk to Mithrandir.\n2\tSet fire to noisome flowers (total: 6)\tSet fire to the noisome flowers.\n3\tTalk to Mithrandir\tTalk to Mithrandir.\n4\tTalk to Mithrandir\tTalk to Mithrandir at the overlook.\n5\tLet Mithrandir execute his plan\tLet Mithrandir execute his plan.\n6\tTalk to Aragorn\tTalk to Aragorn.\n",
[6907]="70000FD4\n1\tEnd the Nazgûl's plans\tSeek out the Nazgûl and end his schemes.\n2\tExamine the obelisk\tExamine the obelisk. You have encountered an obelisk that was glowing faintly.\n3\tInvoke the name of Elbereth at the obelisks (total: 3)\tSeek out the obelisks and open the way to the centre of the treasury. Examination of the obelisk found at the entrance to the treasury revealed that the only way to enter the centre treasury is to invoke the name of Elbereth at obelisks found scattered through out the treasury.\n4\tEnd the Nazgûl's plans\tSeek out the Nazgûl and end his schemes. Now that you have invoked the name of the Elbereth at three of the obelisks in the treasury, the way to the centre of the treasury is open.\n",
[6908]="7006FE5C\n1\tTalk to the guard within the Citadel of Winds\tOne of the guards within the Citadel of Winds thinks to bar your passage to the chamber where meet the Kindred of the Coins.\n2\tEnter the chamber where your husband Tumúldo meets with the other members of the Kindred\tYour husband Tumúldo meets with the other members of the Kindred of the Coins within the Citadel of Winds.\n3\tStand beside Tumúldo while the Kindred of the Coins discusses your presence\tThe Kindred of the Coins debate your presence within the Citadel of Winds.\n4\tThink upon this question: did the Kindred of the Coins live up to its intentions?\tYou must think upon this question: did the Kindred of the Coins live up to its intention?\n5\tStay with Tumúldo as the rest of the Kindred departs\tThe other members of the Kindred leave their meeting, but you and Tumúldo stay behind.\n6\tTalk to Azagath about a secret matter\tAzagath desires to speak with you and Tumúldo about a secret matter.\n7\tRemain with Tumúldo for as long as you can\tEver was Tumúldo your stable rock, even when the days were frightening and the nights long and terrible.\n8\tTake his hand and face whatever comes\tThere was something you wanted to tell your husband, but now you cannot remember what it could have been.\n9\tYour fear, your anger, and your loneliness are gone at last\tYour fear, your anger, and your loneliness dissolves away into the darkness.\n10\tNakási Wave-reaper is gone\tWhatever Nakási may have experienced during her final moments, you hope she is now at peace.\n11\tTalk to Tatháta on the deck of Tumuldo-râba\tTatháta stands upon the deck of Tumuldo-râba, Nakási's flagship.\n",
[6909]="70041184\n1\tSeek Azruthor in the camp at Tarlang's Crown\tAzruthor can be found in the main tent of the camp at Tarlang's Crown. Harnion has asked you to confront and defeat Azruthor in Tarlang's Crown.\n2\tConfront Azruthor\tAzruthor can be found just outside the main tent of the camp at Tarlang's Crown. You have discovered Azruthor's whereabouts and should now confront him.\n3\tDefeat Azruthor\tAzruthor can be found just outside the main tent of the camp at Tarlang's Crown. You should defeat Azruthor and his allies for the good of Gondor.\n4\tDefeat Azruthor\tAzruthor can be found just outside the main tent of the camp at Tarlang's Crown. You should defeat Azruthor and his allies for the good of Gondor.\n",
[6910]="7002EFA7\n1\tTalk to Burnoth\tSpeak with Burnoth.\n2\tDefeat the Khundolar riders\tDefeat the Khundolar riders.\n3\tTalk to Burnoth\tTalk to Burnoth and return to Harwick.\n",
[6911]="70017B88\n1\tPick up the torch\tBring the torch to wherever it needs to be, further within the little cave.\n",
[6912]="70047291\n1\tTalk to Solsi inside the First Hall\tYou have entered Khazad-dûm from the East-gate, and the situation appears worse than you feared.\n2\tFind Bósi and Brogur and escape from Khazad-dûm\tBósi and Brogur have not yet made it back to the East-gate. Solsi asked you to find them, if they still live.\n3\tTalk to Brogur in the First Hall\tBrogur is on the western side of the First Hall.\n4\tTalk to Bósi in the First Hall\tBósi has made it to the First Hall.\n5\tFind Brogur in the First Hall\tBrogur fell behind during the retreat, and Bósi asked you to find his cousin.\n6\tTalk to Bósi in the First Hall\tBósi is in the First Hall, near the East-gate of Khazad-dûm.\n",
})
